{
  "description": "media_rows(nodes, palette, takes): studio's run checks of API 1.22 on a canonical minimax-h3 template with `inputs` merged into its params (contracts/README.md, Media inputs: rows of media): optional image nodes left empty are dropped (with their wires), a rows value while a `not_with` input is wired is refused, then each media field of a rows item (items from 1; a trim field's in / out filled: in 0, out min(duration, max_s)) and each rows param's max_total_s. expect: {error} or {error: null, dropped, values: path → rows as studio sends them}. in / out are on the take's frames already (no snapping here). The counts (rows max) and the cross-param rules (audio needs an image or video, 12 in all, sound) are elsewhere: the rows max and fixtures/video/minimax-h3.json",
